# clamber-scenario v1
id: walk-off-ledge
summary: Walk off a ledge without jumping and fall to lower ground.
requires: a plain edge (no steep face, behavior/steep-faces.md) 48 to 64 px ahead; below it, flat ground exactly 176 px (title-1) or 128 px (title-2) below the ground the player starts on, flat and with nothing in the way as far as the player walks in the 120 frames (under 200 px past the edge)
# The drop is the reference's, not a minimum: the 30-frame curve ends the
# frame before the landing in title-1 and runs through the landing in
# title-2, so with another drop the landing can move into or within it.
start: grounded, idle for at least 30 frames, facing right, lead character
frames: 120

[inputs]
0-119    R

[metrics]
final_x          tol 1
curve x,y,vy from leave_ground for 30 tol 0.25
